Do not merely rename a TypeScript file while leaving TypeScript syntax in it. Rewrite the code into valid JavaScript or PHP as appropriate.

Do not preserve forbidden files in unused directories, backups, alternate source folders, or generated project files.

Do not delete operating-system files or unrelated external environment files. The zero-file requirement applies to the project being developed and delivered.

